// One build for the whole tree. Every module here is in the workspace, so a
// change to a vendored upstream tree is seen by the modules that consume it
// without a tag or a pin in between - which is the point of vendoring them
// (ADR-0005). Each module also carries its own relative replace directives,
// so it still resolves alone with GOWORK=off; the workspace is a convenience
// for building them together, not the only way they resolve.
go 1.27.3

use (
	.
	./forks/cluster-api
	./forks/cluster-api/api
	./forks/cluster-api/test
	./forks/cluster-api-provider-nutanix
	./providers/nutanix-infrastructure
)
